### 数据诊断相关接口测试
### 描述: updateReadStatus、listUnreadDataDiagnosis、getDataDiagnosisStatus 接口测试

### ========================================
### 变量配置
### ========================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:6606
@token = 30ceda03c12f4e73899713839b157249
@videoId = 14321334-910e-474a-b03b-1cd6d6c48773

### ========================================
### 1. 获取数据诊断未读报告列表
### ========================================

### 1.1 获取未读报告列表 - 正常请求
GET {{baseUrl}}/replay/ai/diagnosis/listUnreadDataDiagnosis
token: {{token}}

### ========================================
### 2. 获取视频数据诊断状态与内容
### ========================================

### 2.1 获取数据诊断状态 - 正常请求
GET {{baseUrl}}/replay/ai/diagnosis/getDataDiagnosisStatus?videoId={{videoId}}
token: {{token}}

### 2.2 获取数据诊断状态 - 不存在的videoId
GET {{baseUrl}}/replay/ai/diagnosis/getDataDiagnosisStatus?videoId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
token: {{token}}

### ========================================
### 3. 批量更新诊断报告已读状态
### ========================================

### 3.1 更新为已读 - 正常请求（ids替换为实际的诊断记录id）
POST {{baseUrl}}/replay/ai/diagnosis/updateReadStatus
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}

{
  "ids": [
    1
  ],
  "isRead": 1
}

### 3.2 更新为未读
POST {{baseUrl}}/replay/ai/diagnosis/updateReadStatus
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}

{
  "ids": [
    1
  ],
  "isRead": 0
}

### 3.3 批量更新多条为已读
POST {{baseUrl}}/replay/ai/diagnosis/updateReadStatus
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}

{
  "ids": [
    1,
    2,
    3
  ],
  "isRead": 1
}

### 3.4 不传isRead，默认已读
POST {{baseUrl}}/replay/ai/diagnosis/updateReadStatus
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}

{
  "ids": [
    1
  ]
}
